+        _ => "Lead is always slot 0. After each faint, each remaining Pok\u{e9}mon scores its best damaging move: base power (under 10 counts as 60) times the type chart against you, with no STAB, stats, abilities or items. Each switch-in swaps places in the battle's party order, which settles ties. Read from Black 2 and White 2; Black and White are inferred from them.",
